OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers trained to protect
OL,4,Afemale passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus operator has introduced training
OL,7,Fto teach drivers how to prevent
OL,8,Fviolence against female passengers.
OL,10,FThe course will be delivered to drivers
OL,11,Fof Stagecoach East which operates in
OL,12,Fparts of Bedfordshire and
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, including Peterborough.
OL,15,FOver the next year drivers will receive
OL,16,Ftraining on how to "recognise and react
OL,17,Fto dangerous situations" and techniques
OL,18,Fon how to combat the threats without
OL,19,Fincreasing risk to passengers and
OL,20,Fthemselves.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
