OL,3,GNEWSABus drivers trained to protect
OL,4,Afemale passengers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Roe, managing director of
OL,7,FStagecoach East, said: "Tackling
OL,8,Fviolence against women and girls is
OL,9,Fsomething that we all need to take
OL,10,Fresponsibility for and we are working
OL,11,Fvery hard to play our part in this."
